<p style="font-size:14px;">
  We tried to charge the card on file for <strong><%= @organization.name %></strong>'s
  Pharma Transport subscription and it didn't go through.
</p>

<% if @amount || @plan || @period_end %>
  <table style="font-size:14px; border-collapse:collapse; margin:16px 0;">
    <% if @plan %>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0; color:#666;">Plan</td>
        <td><%= @plan.name %></td>
      </tr>
    <% end %>
    <% if @amount %>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0; color:#666;">Amount due</td>
        <td><%= number_to_currency(@amount) %> / month</td>
      </tr>
    <% end %>
    <% if @period_end %>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0; color:#666;">Billing period ends</td>
        <td><%= @period_end.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></td>
      </tr>
    <% end %>
  </table>
<% end %>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  Stripe will keep retrying for a few weeks, but until the payment clears your
  organization has lost:
</p>

<ul style="font-size:14px;">
  <li>Compliance Packet generation beyond the free monthly allowance</li>
  <li>Your public DSCSA verification badge</li>
  <li>SMS temperature alerts, if you're on Pro or Compliance</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  <%= link_to "Update your payment method", billing_url %>
</p>

<p style="font-size:12px; color:#666;">
  Already fixed it? You can ignore this — everything switches back on automatically
  once Stripe confirms the payment. You're getting this because you're an admin on
  this organization.
</p>
